                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "At least not a bad game if you are searching für a Computer-Version of old school Hex-Boardgames. The strategic mechanics, graphics and the gameplay are well done for this kind of game. The reason why i wouldn´t recommend it is simply missing content. The four scenarios use the same map and are rather short. Every scenario simply starts on another part of the map, as axis or allies. To look like a 80s boardgame is great, to have less content than one is not.",
